@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #e8f0fa
  BorderColor #2f6fb5
  ArrowColor #24292f
}
[*] --> FREE
FREE --> HELD : Acquire commits\ntoken = log index
HELD --> HELD : heartbeat extends the lease\n(same token)
HELD --> FREE : Release(token)\ncompare by token
HELD --> EXPIRED : no heartbeat for one lease\nSessionExpired committed
HELD --> REVOKED : ForceRevoke (audited)
EXPIRED --> FREE : names freed
REVOKED --> FREE : names freed
FREE --> HELD : next grant\nstrictly higher token
note right of EXPIRED
  The old holder may not know.
  Its writes carry the old token
  and the resource rejects them.
end note
@enduml
